Bound queued large VIF1 packets before submission when GOW_VU1_EARLY_FINISH is enabled.
Defaults to the asynchronous-FINISH setting; explicit 0 disables it. Sample configuration per PS2Memory instance.
Use the existing worker/GS-stage idle barrier; packet size is a heuristic, not a frame boundary.
No gameplay performance measurement is claimed by this patch.

